{"name": "FreeStyle Football 2", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Freestyle Football 2</strong> is an online multiplayer soccer game featuring 5v5 matches with unique character roles and skills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Play Your Own Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004820/extras/b82a81a9455ade4e3b4ee0133e19d77a.poster.avif?t=1785588960\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004820/extras/b82a81a9455ade4e3b4ee0133e19d77a.webm?t=1785588960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004820/extras/b82a81a9455ade4e3b4ee0133e19d77a.mp4?t=1785588960\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Freestyle Football 2</strong> is an <strong>online multiplayer football game</strong> that combines fast-paced matches, flashy individual skills, and team play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each position has a unique role. Use a variety of strategies and skills to claim victory with your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stylish moves and distinctive characters turn the field into a stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Team Play Powered by Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004820/extras/35e9fa3ed78fd9c0b7c1486cf2331f5e.poster.avif?t=1785588960\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004820/extras/35e9fa3ed78fd9c0b7c1486cf2331f5e.webm?t=1785588960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004820/extras/35e9fa3ed78fd9c0b7c1486cf2331f5e.mp4?t=1785588960\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Freestyle Football 2</strong> is an <strong>online multiplayer football game</strong> that combines fast-paced matches, flashy individual skills, and team play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each position has a unique role. Use a variety of strategies and skills to claim victory with your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stylish moves and distinctive characters turn the field into a stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Strategic Formations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004820/extras/86a1e3e7d9f7234eac161444ac6b631d.poster.avif?t=1785588960\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004820/extras/86a1e3e7d9f7234eac161444ac6b631d.webm?t=1785588960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004820/extras/86a1e3e7d9f7234eac161444ac6b631d.mp4?t=1785588960\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s more than one way to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Push forward with an aggressive formation to pressure your opponents, or sit back with a solid defense and strike on the counter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on different roles with your teammates, adapt your strategy to the flow of the match, and experience true team play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Arenas Full of Character</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004820/extras/562250cfaad74cc0a7da7f731820798c.poster.avif?t=1785588960\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004820/extras/562250cfaad74cc0a7da7f731820798c.webm?t=1785588960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004820/extras/562250cfaad74cc0a7da7f731820798c.mp4?t=1785588960\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From fields set in the heart of the city to fields set against iconic landmarks around the world, every map offers a different atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each map isn\u2019t just a backdrop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Make It Your Moment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004820/extras/f1d79f5559cc70d7b57939893e1ee29a.poster.avif?t=1785588960\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004820/extras/f1d79f5559cc70d7b57939893e1ee29a.webm?t=1785588960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004820/extras/f1d79f5559cc70d7b57939893e1ee29a.mp4?t=1785588960\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scoring a goal is the biggest thrill in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Express your team\u2019s victory with a unique celebration and make the moment yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cap off the match highlight with a stylish performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Every Character Has a Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004820/extras/991abced85c4535b54073214fcd7c355.poster.avif?t=1785588960\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004820/extras/991abced85c4535b54073214fcd7c355.webm?t=1785588960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004820/extras/991abced85c4535b54073214fcd7c355.mp4?t=1785588960\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each character in Freestyle Football 2 has their own background and personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet a diverse cast, learn their stories, and dive deeper into the world of Freestyle Football 2.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Freestyle Football 2 is a fast-paced, 5v5 match-based online multiplayer soccer game. Each position has a unique role, and you'll utilize a variety of strategies and skills to achieve victory with your team. Stylish play and unique characters transform the pitch into a stage.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004